<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UtiliCorp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UtiliCorp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded UtiliCorp United Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- maintained an intermediate-term accumulate on the stock.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 5/8 to 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
